GVRf IO

This folder contains files required to implement User Interaction with GVRf using external input sources.

The Standard Translation Library (or STL) is a helper library provides reuseable classes to help developers
integrate input devices faster.

The InputSample folder contains a sample program that demonstrates using a Samsung Gamepad with GVRf.
It makes use of the STL to generate InputEvents for the GVRInputManager. Make sure you import the 
STL library project to build the InputSample GVRf application.

Game Controllers supported for now:

1) Samsung Gamepad
2) Steel Series Stratus XL
3) Sony Dualshock 3 (tested using an USB OTG cable)
3) Sony Dualshock 4 (tested using an USB OTG cable)

Note: Make sure that the controller is paired with the Samsung Device before launching the app.


